THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

This file does not restate any third-party copyright notice. The notices are
in the upstream files themselves, shipped unchanged:
  - licenses/ holds the upstream licence files, each a byte-for-byte copy of
    the pinned file named in licenses/MANIFEST.csv (URL, SHA-256, download
    date);
  - each embedded font keeps its own copyright record (OpenType name ID 0)
    unchanged in the binary. licenses/FONT-SOURCES.csv names the upstream
    font file each subset was made from (URL, SHA-256, download date).
`python3 tests/check_licenses.py --online` re-downloads every licence file
and every upstream font, checks their SHA-256, and checks that each embedded
font's copyright record is identical to the upstream font's. The offline
mode (no arguments, run in CI) checks the hashes and file lists.

All files listed in licenses/MANIFEST.csv and licenses/FONT-SOURCES.csv were
downloaded on 2026-09-24. Short forms used below:
